#pragma once

// Sly 3: Honor Among Thieves (USA, SCUS-97464): THE game table. Every Sly 3-specific number of this port is here or
// in the generated rows of game/gen/*.inc that this header includes (notes/PLAN.md "The game table").
//
// - Hand-written knowledge (the disc, the executable's tables, engine addresses, ids the code names): namespace sly3.
//   "orig3: 0x..." in a comment is a Sly 3 address; "orig: 0x..." in code copied from Sly2-Release stays the Sly 2
//   address until the function is re-derived from the Sly 3 asm.
// - The Sly 2 -> Sly 3 maps (generated by the maps code; seeded by tools/seedmaps3.py): the copied Sly 2 code names a class,
//   option, built-in, tag, function or global by its Sly 2 number through one of these, all compile-time lookups:
//       S3CID(0x35)  S3EOPID(233)  S3BIF(46)  S3TAG(21)  S3FN(0x13DA18)  S3VA(0x2BAAE8)
//   A Sly 2 number missing from its table does not compile; one whose row says "no Sly 3 counterpart" yields -1
//   (sly3::CID_NONE ...), which no object, option or built-in has. `grep -n 'S3CID('` lists every converted site.

#include <cstddef>
#include <cstdint>
#include <type_traits>

